  "description": "GIZVOA crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H96 Eu4 O20. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu1B (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu1C (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.837-4.161 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.90-108.16°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula {[Eu(μ3-η2-OCH2CH2OMe)(η2-OCH2CH2OMe)(OC6H3Me2-2,6)-][H+]}4.",
